  "saved_rows": {
    "UP-ISSUE-1132": "| [UP-ISSUE-1132](https://github.com/Soju06/codex-lb/issues/1132) | #1132: UI account section bag — account-list overflow, связан PR #1149 | Раздел 4, L622 | ПРОВЕРЕНО / ЗАКРЫТО ЛОКАЛЬНО | §100: account list/detail overflow independently verified at390/768/1440; fixed tall export dialog with bounded scrolling and reachable Download/Close. [Evidence](openspec/changes/archive/2026-10-14-repair-five-account-access-contracts/verification.md). |",
    "UP-DISC-636": "| [UP-DISC-636](https://github.com/Soju06/codex-lb/discussions/636) | #636: Import&#124;Export Accaunts | Раздел 11, L1302 | ПРОВЕРЕНО / ЗАКРЫТО ЛОКАЛЬНО | §100: Export action and OAuth/OpenCode behavior verified; fixed null/missing ID+refresh schema/rendering/copy controls and retained identity in downloaded auth.json. [Evidence](openspec/changes/archive/2026-10-14-repair-five-account-access-contracts/verification.md). |",
    "UP-DISC-1593": "| [UP-DISC-1593](https://github.com/Soju06/codex-lb/discussions/1593) | #1593: Reauthentication when switching Business accounts: same workspace vs different workspace | Раздел 11, L1257 | ПРОВЕРЕНО / ЗАКРЫТО ЛОКАЛЬНО | §100: fixed opaque auth export/import metadata loss; same-workspace siblings and same email/different workspaces remain isolated; targeted OAuth mismatch/seat tests PASS. Live sign-outs and cross-workspace conversation continuity remain unverified. [Evidence](openspec/changes/archive/2026-10-14-repair-five-account-access-contracts/verification.md). |",
    "UP-ISSUE-1919": "| [UP-ISSUE-1919](https://github.com/Soju06/codex-lb/issues/1919) | #1919 / PR #2429: bug: Need to reauthenticate accounts with Advanced Account Security every single day | Раздел 4, L624 | ПРОВЕРЕНО / ЗАКРЫТО ЛОКАЛЬНО | §100: current Guardian/AuthManager keepalive/rotation/failure ownership independently verified. Idle>12h remains separate from request freshness; dynamic leadership and fresh-credential CAS PASS. Live daily Advanced Account Security session loss is not reproduced or globally claimed fixed. [Evidence](openspec/changes/archive/2026-10-14-repair-five-account-access-contracts/verification.md). |",
    "UP-DISC-884": "| [UP-DISC-884](https://github.com/Soju06/codex-lb/discussions/884) | #884: Idea: API-based authorization flow for accounts when SMS verification is unavailable | Раздел 11, L1318 | ПРОВЕРЕНО / ЗАКРЫТО ЛОКАЛЬНО | §100: existing Model Sources API-key flow verified through encrypted/redacted storage and real synthetic Responses dispatch with no subscription accounts. PAT export repaired; operator context distinguishes source API billing from subscription credentials. No SMS/security bypass or live entitlement claim. [Evidence](openspec/changes/archive/2026-10-14-repair-five-account-access-contracts/verification.md). |"
  },
